  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **The Animator**: rare: 14 archived performances [3]\n- **Taking The Farm**: rare: 11 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **twod2012-11-10.crankingamps** (recommended): source not stated; 10 songs; 48 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]. Said about its sound: Recorded outdoors on grass, fifteen meters from the stage, with no equalization or compression [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- The band appeared on the bill behind the group Fuck Buttons [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **twod2012-11-10.crankingamps**: taped by crankingamps; transferred by crankingamps; source: dpa4061 > csbb > pcmm10 > wav [1]. Also: Audio captured via DPA4061 mics, Core Sound Battery Box, and Sony PCM-M10 recorder [1]",
